      "title": "Which env can even import this",
      "text": "transformers/models/qwen3_5 exists only in the lingbot-vomni env (tf 5.14.1). The serving `vllm` env's transformers predates it, so the reference implementation on this page cannot be loaded there — but vLLM's own qwen3_5.py can, and that is what the :9000 endpoint runs.",
