    {
      "row": "notes",
      "title": "Comparing all four models in this atlas",
      "text": "Wan conditions every block on the timestep and cross-attends text. H3 packs every modality into one sequence and looks modulation up per row. Gemma-4 alternates two attention geometries and wraps each sublayer in four norms. Qwen3.8 alternates a recurrence with attention and keeps the plainest block of the four.",
      "code": [
        {
          "role": "definition",
          "src": "qwen35.hf",
